{
  "name": "Voice Receptionist 2/3 - Post-Call Intelligence (CRM, HITL)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "763e0283-4df4-44de-9145-86fb27a8f4a7",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -360
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 960,
        "height": 300,
        "content": "## Voice Receptionist 2/3 - Post-Call Intelligence\nReceives the end-of-call report from workflow 1 -> GPT analysis (intent, outcome, sentiment, urgency, lead score, follow-up draft; fallback: keyword rules) -> call log (Sheet) -> Zoho lead upsert (4 retries; fallback: CRM_Queue + alert) + call note.\n\n**Selective alerts:** only high-urgency/emergency calls and CRM failures email you.\n**HITL:** complaints, negative sentiment, high urgency or `needsHuman` -> manager approval email. Approve = AI follow-up is sent to the caller (SMS, email fallback). Decline = Zoho task for staff.\n\n**Setup:** same credentials as workflow 1; Sheet tabs `Call_Log`, `CRM_Queue`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "eb62dc07-9c9b-4ffc-80d7-3fc32ee5229b",
      "name": "Post-Call Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vapi-post-call",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "Vapi / Pipeline Shared Secret"
        }
      },
      "webhookId": "7aa5bd6c-f10c-4ae5-ab3e-b6b400440b04"
    },
    {
      "id": "48b63f1a-ffca-4032-b6f8-d0b7fb04e210",
      "name": "Extract Report",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst body = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\nconst m = body.message || {}, call = m.call || {}, a = m.analysis || {};\nconst dur = m.durationSeconds ?? ((m.startedAt && m.endedAt) ? (new Date(m.endedAt) - new Date(m.startedAt)) / 1000 : 0);\nreturn [{ json: { callId: call.id || '', phone: (call.customer?.number || '').replace(/[^\\d+]/g, ''), startedAt: m.startedAt || '', endedAt: m.endedAt || '',\n  durationSec: Math.round(dur || 0), endedReason: m.endedReason || '', vapiSummary: m.summary || a.summary || '',\n  transcript: String(m.artifact?.transcript || m.transcript || '').slice(0, 12000), recordingUrl: m.recordingUrl || m.artifact?.recordingUrl || '', cost: m.cost || 0 } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e95b29be-3b9b-44cb-b76c-224dd3a5d8a1",
      "name": "Meaningful Call?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        480,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "673a96ae-7108-4e57-bc2d-e907e27e7a1b",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.durationSec >= 8 && $json.transcript.length > 40 }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1c4f20df-d0c6-4910-86f0-d489e6ccb847",
      "name": "AI Analysis - OpenAI",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        720,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'gpt-4o-mini', temperature: 0.2, response_format: { type: 'json_object' }, messages: [ { role: 'system', content: \"You analyze phone calls handled by an AI receptionist. Return ONLY JSON: {\\\"intent\\\":\\\"booking|reschedule|cancel|inquiry|complaint|emergency|spam|other\\\",\\\"outcome\\\":\\\"booked|rescheduled|cancelled|callback_needed|info_only|abandoned\\\",\\\"sentiment\\\":\\\"positive|neutral|negative\\\",\\\"urgency\\\":\\\"low|medium|high\\\",\\\"leadScore\\\":0-100,\\\"callerName\\\":string,\\\"email\\\":string,\\\"summary\\\":string (max 50 words),\\\"actionItems\\\":[string],\\\"followUpDraft\\\":string (a short, warm SMS to the caller, max 280 chars, no promises about prices or medical advice),\\\"needsHuman\\\":boolean}. Set needsHuman=true for complaints, emergencies, anger, legal/medical-risk topics, or unresolved requests.\" }, { role: 'user', content: JSON.stringify($json) } ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 45000
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "openAiApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE",
          "name": "OpenAI account"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "1c74062b-27dd-4703-bcc5-c40da4e50666",
      "name": "Parse Analysis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nlet r = null;\ntry { r = JSON.parse($input.first().json.choices[0].message.content); } catch (e) {}\nif (!r || !r.intent || !r.summary) return [{ json: { __bad: true } }];\nreturn [{ json: { intent: r.intent, outcome: r.outcome || 'info_only', sentiment: r.sentiment || 'neutral', urgency: r.urgency || 'low',\n  leadScore: Number(r.leadScore || 0), callerName: r.callerName || '', email: r.email || '', summary: r.summary, actionItems: r.actionItems || [],\n  followUpDraft: r.followUpDraft || '', needsHuman: !!r.needsHuman, mode: 'ai' } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "a9a7c4e3-9cda-45b9-b4b6-fc733b67da24",
      "name": "Rule-Based Analysis (fallback)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst c = $('Extract Report').first().json, t = c.transcript.toLowerCase();\nconst emergency = /emergency|urgent|bleeding|severe pain|can't breathe|accident/.test(t);\nconst complaint = /complain|angry|terrible|worst|unacceptable|refund|furious/.test(t);\nconst intent = emergency ? 'emergency' : complaint ? 'complaint' : /cancel/.test(t) ? 'cancel' : /reschedul|move my/.test(t) ? 'reschedule' : /book|appointment|schedule/.test(t) ? 'booking' : 'inquiry';\nreturn [{ json: { intent, outcome: /booked|confirmed/.test(t) ? 'booked' : 'info_only', sentiment: complaint ? 'negative' : 'neutral', urgency: emergency ? 'high' : complaint ? 'medium' : 'low',\n  leadScore: intent === 'booking' ? 60 : 30, callerName: '', email: '', summary: (c.vapiSummary || 'Call recorded - AI analysis unavailable.').slice(0, 300), actionItems: ['Review call manually'],\n  followUpDraft: '', needsHuman: emergency || complaint, mode: 'rules' } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f44d8fb1-d9df-4f9c-8b1e-00e94e04f237",
      "name": "Build Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1220,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst c = $('Extract Report').first().json;\nlet a = $input.first().json;\nif (a.__bad) { a = { intent: 'other', outcome: 'info_only', sentiment: 'neutral', urgency: 'low', leadScore: 20, callerName: '', email: '', summary: c.vapiSummary || 'Analysis unavailable', actionItems: ['Review call manually'], followUpDraft: '', needsHuman: true, mode: 'rules(parse-fail)' }; }\nconst needsReview = a.needsHuman || a.sentiment === 'negative' || a.urgency === 'high' || ['complaint', 'emergency'].includes(a.intent);\nconst urgentAlert = a.urgency === 'high' || a.intent === 'emergency';\nconst desc = [`AI call summary (${a.mode}): ${a.summary}`, `Intent: ${a.intent} | Outcome: ${a.outcome} | Sentiment: ${a.sentiment} | Urgency: ${a.urgency}`,\n  a.actionItems.length ? 'Actions: ' + a.actionItems.join('; ') : '', c.recordingUrl ? 'Recording: ' + c.recordingUrl : ''].filter(Boolean).join('\\n');\nconst record = { Last_Name: a.callerName || ('Caller ' + (c.phone || '').slice(-4)), Phone: c.phone || undefined, Email: a.email || undefined, Company: 'Phone Inquiry',\n  Lead_Status: a.outcome === 'booked' ? 'Pre-Qualified' : 'Contacted', Description: desc };\nreturn [{ json: { c, a, needsReview, urgentAlert, record, zohoBody: { data: [record], duplicate_check_fields: ['Phone'], trigger: ['workflow'] } } }];\n"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1c7dad82-8e4f-4a39-bbc3-e733cfccb262",
      "name": "Make Call Log Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1480,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "\nconst p = $input.first().json, c = p.c, a = p.a;\nreturn [{ json: { timestamp: new Date().toISOString(), callId: c.callId, phone: c.phone, durationSec: c.durationSec, endedReason: c.endedReason, intent: a.intent, outcome: a.outcome,\n  sentiment: a.sentiment, urgency: a.urgency, leadScore: a.leadScore, needsReview: p.needsReview, summary: a.summary, recordingUrl: c.recordingUrl, cost: c.cost, analysisMode: a.mode } }];\n"
      }
    },
